The Second ACP-EEC Convention was signed on 31 October 1979.

```catala
declaration scope ACP_EEC_Signing:
  output signing_date content date
```

The signing date of the Second ACP-EEC Convention is 31 October 1979.
```catala
scope ACP_EEC_Signing:
  date round down
  definition signing_date equals |1979-10-31|
```